      "text": {
        "jp": "敵にもレベルがあります。\r\n格上の敵に対してはブレイクゲージを削りづらくなります。\r\n\r\nなかなかブレイクゲージを削れずに苦戦した時には\r\nお互いのレベルを確認し\r\n劣っている場合はレベルを上げて再度挑んでみましょう。",
        "official_en": "Enemies also have levels, with higher-level enemies\r\nbeing more difficult to stagger.\r\n\r\nIf you are having trouble staggering an enemy, check\r\nto see how your level compares to theirs. If your level\r\nis lower, try raising it before taking on that foe again.",
        "real_en": "Enemies have levels too. The higher an enemy’s level is than yours, the harder it will be to reduce its Break gauge.\r\n\r\nIf you struggle to reduce an enemy’s Break gauge, compare your levels. If yours is lower, try leveling up before challenging that enemy again."
      },
